ations.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri4509\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 You will notice the Converter Capacity was 385 for the V-6 and shows a 7480 RPM for the current Stall RPM.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 This makes sense since this is was a loose converter for a higher RPM, lower torque producing engine.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Now the converter has now been coupled with a high torque big block.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Stall speed would be very high.\expnd14\expndtw68  \expnd0\expndtw0 You could pick an example converter or simply enter your known stall RPM of 4500 and press enter.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 The program responds that due to rounding in the calculations, the resulting Converter Capacity of 212.7 gives a Stall RPM of 4620.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 This is adequate for our purposes, because we can\'92t read the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 tachometer\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 accurate\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 anyway.\expnd10\expndtw48  \expnd0\expndtw0 For\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Torque\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Multiplication,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 we\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 change\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 left\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 over\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 1.7\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 from\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 V-6 to a more typical 2.0. (Notice how this Stall RPM is based on the current Power Curve and Track Weather Conditions, which is why we entered Weather Specs before going to the Transmission Specs.)\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri4551\sl244\slmult1\sb229\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Click on the Transmission Type combo box and select\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Pick Example Transmission.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 From\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the list\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 of transmissions, select the\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Auto-Turbo Hydra-Matic 400.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Either double click on it to select it in one stroke,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 click on it\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 to highlight\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 it,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 then click on the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Pick button.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 You\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 will\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 next\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 be\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 presented with a\par
